<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-ILLGNER MAY MAKE REAL MADRID DEBUT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ILLGNER MAY MAKE REAL MADRID DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former German international goalkeeper Bodo Illgner is expected to make his debut for Real Madrid at home to Hercules on Sunday after arriving in Spain on Thursday.</p>
<p>The former Cologne player, a World Cup winner in 1990, went on to win 54 caps before retiring from the national side after the 1994 tournament.</p>
